{
  "compositions": [
    {
      "name": "big_bell",
      "path": "big_bell/",
      "prompt_texts": {
        "10a84d4d05822c4cb9ff3cfa298480d025bd4edf37d51371bbcc247cb48b1a3e": "# big_bell - prompt 005\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-20T18:14:15Z; source: user -->\n\nNew version, CM9, each stroke at a higher octave.\n",
        "22e954c7cc6f0d6d0a74d988e08e81af361191f78952723574e48bafb57afb60": "# big_bell - prompt 004\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-20T18:10:40Z; source: user -->\n\nGood. Now a new version. CM7 in just intonation, one bell stroke after another at 2 second intervals.\n",
        "7235d173bf7e1cb2334bdd8a0d3fc3f7b7c8d59b950a792688c5f234d7cde221": "# big_bell - prompt 007\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-20T19:04:09Z; source: user -->\n\nNot alternating. Mirror the ascent, also with 2 second delays, starting from the top note and going down by quartal harmony plus an octave.\n",
        "776861008f933c79ea2f4841da6c43c61089f577fb83091b2b4ea6f1090b4076": "# big_bell - prompt 001\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-16T10:49:33Z; source: user -->\n\nCreate a piece that is one stroke of a giant bronze bell that decays for 2 minutes. There should be many inharmonic partials, combination tones, and phasing; feed through reverbsc. Fix the following error: the render clips: 1369 samples out of range. Lower the output level (or pass --allow-clipping if it is intended) (log: /Users/michaelgogins/michael.gogins.studio/music/ai-compositions/.staging/big_bell-20261116T104721Z-fd3165/outputs/big_bell-render.log)\n\nAlso fix:Compiling Csound code... syntax error, Unable to find opcode entry for 'expon' with matching argument types, line 17 columns 8-12 Found: a expon c, k, c Candidates: k expon i, i, i a expon i, i, i Line: 17 columns 8-12 from file big_bell.csd (1) Parsing failed due to syntax errors\n",
        "9357a925226f7252faddcd5c2f20deb7fe32243dfc1d12ae04a5d07400c50196": "# big_bell - prompt 002\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-16T10:51:56Z; source: user -->\n\nMore of a \"clank\" or \"clang\" at the stroke of the bell.\n",
        "a7afc19da9824573c08222074ff0d12e364f44fecb4b9a6d478e143c94563a76": "# big_bell - prompt 006\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-20T19:01:51Z; source: user -->\n\nNow 40 seconds in, down from D by fourths and octaves.\n",
        "b5a30c29d160a656cdf9830973d7fc5ef7567b5d3f1e93f79ae84989c1de1f17": "# big_bell - prompt 003\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-20T18:06:42Z; source: user -->\n\nFollow studio-tools/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md. Revise Big Bell: There are clicks in the attack segment of the bell envelope. Remove them if possible, or explain if not. Render, accept, publish, and push to master.\n",
        "d86587d65a7c23e8cdb9b75a1ffc363dd9b48996b9b6b7763113cda38cf83bd1": "# big_bell - prompt 008\n\n<!-- recorded: 2026-11-20T19:37:50Z; source: user -->\n\nCorrect. Wait 30 seconds then back up from the lowest note in thirds plus octaves at twice the tempo.\n"
      },
      "title": "Big Bell",
